-extends "channels/channel_claim_form.html"
-load i18n compress temba

-block pre-form
  -blocktrans trimmed with name=brand.name
    You can connect a <a href="https://slack.com/app">Slack bot</a> to your {{name}} workspace to automate sending and
    receiving messages.

  -blocktrans trimmed
    To do this, you'll need to create a new Slack app and configure it.

  %ol.steps.card
    %li
      -blocktrans trimmed
        You'll need to create a <a href="https://api.slack.com/apps">Slack app</a> if you haven't already, set up a
        bot for it, add the needed scopes and install the app on your Slack workspace. If you need help, read the
        guide <a href="https://api.slack.com/bot-users">here</a>.
